FFmpeg libraries @RAWREEL_FFMPEG_HEADING@

avutil, avcodec, avformat, avfilter, swscale and swresample are the unchanged "lgpl" shared
libraries of custom_ffmpeg @CUSTOM_FFMPEG_VERSION@ (FFmpeg @FFMPEG_VERSION@). They are licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.
The licence texts are in the licenses folder@RAWREEL_FFMPEG_AT@,
and build-info.txt@RAWREEL_FFMPEG_THERE@ shows how they were configured.

rawreel loads these libraries at run time and is not linked with them. You may replace them with
your own LGPL shared build of FFmpeg that uses the same file names, or delete @RAWREEL_FFMPEG_FOLDER@
(rawreel then opens no container files and no lavfi: graphs). Each library must have the major
version of the one it replaces and at least its minor version:
@FFMPEG_LIBRARY_VERSIONS@
An older one, a GPL build or a non-free build is refused.@RAWREEL_FFMPEG_RESIGN@

The complete corresponding source of FFmpeg is the tag v@CUSTOM_FFMPEG_VERSION@ of the
custom_ffmpeg repository, with its submodules and build scripts (the configure line included):
@RAWREEL_CUSTOM_FFMPEG_TAG_URL@@RAWREEL_LAME_NOTE@@RAWREEL_AMF_NOTE@
